  <item>
    <title>05. 来自一个中德组合家庭中妈妈的心路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67170517db2cf82757f6d58e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67170517db2cf82757f6d58e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Oct 2024 01:51:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>随着陶陶去美国开启了她的下一段繁忙而精彩的学习旅程，面面也开始寻找老刀和陶陶以外的交流对象，想看看不同的家庭都是怎么带娃的。对于面面，这也算是一种记录，没准会在聊天中缓解一些焦虑，找到一些共鸣。也期待下次和老刀和陶陶聊天的时候，我们都能有新的视角和新的思考。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天的嘉宾是一个中德混血宝宝的妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="39">00:39</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="109">01:49</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>选择托班/幼儿园的心路历程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="362">06:02</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>家庭中的分工协作安排</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="654">10:54</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>在中国找part-time工作比较难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="726">12:06</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>带娃是一项比上班更劳累和琐碎的工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1097">18:17</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>关于培养孩子多语言环境的考虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1316">21:56</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>中国妈妈和德国妈妈养孩子有啥区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1546">25:46</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>德国教育从小学四年级就分流</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1696">28:16</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>超贴心的停薪留职以及欧洲职场对于有孩家庭的友好操作</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgZST4EzdrYwdrXFrEF6iggp4vu-.m4a" length="66641449" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:34:31</itunes:duration>
