  <item>
    <title>04. 怎样培养好奇心</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6674415db6a841272931103f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6674415db6a841272931103f</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 28 Jun 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>老刀会挑战陶陶的舒适区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">04:03</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>好奇心就是把自己的一个舒适的状态推到一个不确定的状态；但过于困难也会扼杀好奇心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="277">04:37</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>通过读书给陶陶制造悬念感而促进好奇心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="334">05:34</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>通过制造一些有惊喜的游戏来激发陶陶的好奇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="383">06:23</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>惊险的阿拉斯加冰川事件具体展现了老刀和陶陶的拉扯（不宜模仿）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="793">13:13</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>老刀承认冰川事件有点过火，并没有考虑到陶陶的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="847">14:07</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>根据孩子的不同，让孩子在一个合适的范围内探索好奇心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="988">16:28</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>面面提问怎么能培养在某个方面持续的好奇心而不是三分钟热度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1149">19:09</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>父母亲不断地给孩子提供信息缺口，可以培养持续的好奇心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>父母要学会怎么引导孩子去问问题，思考问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1215">20:15</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>陶陶推荐费曼写的书中关于父亲如何培养了费曼质疑和探究的精神</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1399">23:19</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>想要培养孩子的好奇心，父母要展示出自己的无知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1785">29:45</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>带孩子去不同的地方和设定也可以培养好奇心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2044">34:04</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>家长不能着急，如果抱有“这都不行”的心态孩子会很受伤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>利用好小孩子想要impress父母的心理也有效</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2258">37:38</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>老刀因为有了女儿，更加愿意尝试新的事物，从而焕“花”青春</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luLfd2fMqDn5B1J8wluQ4JSH_7jE.m4a" length="20791635" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:19</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpekmxo-QwaiJAtjXM62m3konfDf.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>4</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>03. 二胎否</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667453e3c26e396a363c3fc3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667453e3c26e396a363c3fc3</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Jun 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8">00:08</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>要不要二娃？面面不太确定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="322">05:22</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>老刀认为带孩子的过程是去共同体验一次童年，让她希望能有更多这样的经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="604">10:04</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>面面的一种小小的个人英雄主义虚荣心让她选择一个人带娃，累并骄傲着</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="663">11:03</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>面面坦诚二胎相对于事业可能是一个更具确定性的社会意义上的成功，害怕二胎也许会变成事业躺平的“借口”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1359">22:39</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>外国妈妈一人带多娃？她们很多也都是不上班或做兼职，似乎不能两全</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1418">23:38</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>全职爸爸？在妈妈主带娃的环境下全职爸爸也很困难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1514">25:14</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>因为确定想体验有孩子的人生所以选择了生一个孩子，但第二个孩子的契机是什么呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1664">27:44</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>什么算是事业成功？老刀认为这并没有标准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1868">31:08</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>陶陶分享朋友的故事，多孩家庭要摆正每个孩子的位置</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2114">35:14</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>文文认为以面面亲力亲为的个性，二胎可能威胁到两人婚姻 LOL</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2159">35:59</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>老刀说也许能够调教身边的人符合你的带娃标准，把自己释放出来，也是一种值得骄傲的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2319">38:39</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>文文认为要把两个孩子独立对待，他们是自己，而不是为了给谁带来什么好处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2732">45:32</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>也许先去赶紧做自己最想做的事情，随着事情的进展，二胎与否也会有新的看法</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ll-A4mmj1GxFAuL9D3g4g9dDaoan.m4a" length="23552988" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpekmxo-QwaiJAtjXM62m3konfDf.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>3</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>02. 怎样学会坚持和放弃</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65fd13be1519139e4fe4f4f3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65fd13be1519139e4fe4f4f3</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Mar 2024 05:14:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="111">00:01:51</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么培养坚持</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">00:04:25</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>培养坚持从日常小事做起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="419">00:06:59</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>家长云淡风轻孩子才能不抗拒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="688">00:11:28</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>规律的作息成为培养坚持的基石</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">00:20:02</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>家庭成员要保持统一态度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1499">00:24:59</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>在课外班里如何坚=贯彻坚持的态度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">00:31:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>一对一的舞蹈老师保护了陶陶的自信心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2339">00:38:59</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>在擅长的领域参加比赛让陶陶享受挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2607">00:43:27</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>通过设立一些跳一跳就能够到的小目标来建立自信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2835">00:47:15</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>在不擅长的领域参加竞赛会打击孩子的自信心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3079">00:51:19</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>只和自己比，不和别人比</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3170">00:52:50</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>什么时候要学会放弃？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4209">01:10:09</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>陶陶和老刀用逻辑图分析要不要放弃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4339">01:12:19</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>作为妈妈，学会放弃，让自己开心松弛，甚至更重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4954">01:22:34</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>关于坚持话题的总结</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luBa4OkcPdGmHgX0NJJ393C3AMB4.m4a" length="164969252" type="audio/mp4"/>
